---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /work/
title: Work
description: "Case studies from Nepal: hiti stone-spout research, groundwater recharge, the Rajkulo canal, heritage walks and robotics in Lalitpur’s public schools."
pageJs: work-filter
---
{#-
  /work/ — all case studies. Filters are progressive enhancement: without JS
  every project is listed; work-filter.js adds the chips' behaviour, the live
  count and ?domain= in the URL. Featured projects get the large layout.
-#}
{%- set work = collections.work -%}
{%- set domainKeys = ["water", "heritage", "education"] -%}
{%- set featuredItems = work | where("data.featured", true) -%}
{%- set featuredCount = featuredItems | length -%}

<header class="page-hero page-hero--split work-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><span aria-current="page">Work</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Case studies</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Spouts, canals and <em>classrooms</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Projects from my work as a civil engineer, heritage practitioner and educator in the Kathmandu Valley — what each one needed, what I did, and what came of it.</p>
    <div class="page-hero__aside card work-key">
      <div class="card__body">
      <p class="label work-key__title">Field index</p>
      <dl class="ledger">
        {%- for key in domainKeys %}
        {%- set n = (work | where("data.domain", key)) | length %}
        {%- if n %}
        <div>
          <dt>{{ workDomains[key].label }}</dt>
          <dd><span class="work-key__count">{{ n }}</span> {{ workDomains[key].blurb }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </dl>
      <p class="label work-key__coords">{% icon "map-pin" %}{{ site.locality }} · {{ site.coordinates.lat }}° N, {{ site.coordinates.lng }}° E</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section work-catalogue" aria-label="Projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="filter-bar js-only" data-work-filter>
      <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects by domain">
        <button class="chip" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All <span class="chip__count">{{ work.length }}</span></button>
        {%- for key in domainKeys %}
        {%- set n = (work | where("data.domain", key)) | length %}
        <button class="chip" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="{{ key }}" data-noun="{{ workDomains[key].noun }}"{% if not n %} disabled{% endif %}>{{ workDomains[key].label }} <span class="chip__count">{{ n }}</span></button>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="label label--plain filter-bar__status" role="status" data-filter-status>Showing all {{ work.length }} projects</p>
    </div>

    {%- if featuredCount %}
    <div class="work-group" data-filter-group>
      <h2 class="visually-hidden">Featured projects</h2>
      <ul class="work-features" role="list" data-filter-layout>
        {#- Unfiltered, the 1st and 4th are wide horizontal cards (work.css). #}
        {%- for item in featuredItems %}
        {%- set d = workDomains[item.data.domain] or workDomains.water %}
        {%- set wide = loop.index == 1 or loop.index == 4 %}
        <li class="work-features__item" data-filter-item data-domain="{{ item.data.domain }}">
          <article class="card card--link work-card{% if wide %} card--horizontal card--feature{% endif %}{% if loop.index == 4 %} card--reverse{% endif %}" data-domain="{{ item.data.domain }}">
            <div class="card__media">{% media item.data.cover, "", { ratio: "3/2", kind: item.data.coverKind or d.kind, sizes: "(min-width: 72rem) 40rem, (min-width: 40rem) 50vw, 100vw" } %}</div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <p class="card__meta"><span>{{ d.label }}</span>{% if item.data.years %}<span>{{ item.data.years }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
              <h3 class="card__title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h3>
              {%- if item.data.summary %}<p class="card__text">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
              {%- if item.data.role %}<p class="work-card__role"><span class="label">Role</span> {{ item.data.role }}</p>{% endif %}
              <div class="card__footer"><span class="card__cue" aria-hidden="true">Read the case study{% icon "arrow-right" %}</span></div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}

    {%- if work.length > featuredCount %}
    <div class="work-group work-more" data-filter-group>
      <header class="section-head work-more__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Also in the notebook</p>
        <h2>More projects</h2>
      </header>
      <ul class="work-rows" role="list">
        {%- for item in work %}
        {%- if not item.data.featured %}
        {%- set d = workDomains[item.data.domain] or workDomains.water %}
        <li data-filter-item data-domain="{{ item.data.domain }}">
          <article class="card card--link work-row" data-domain="{{ item.data.domain }}">
            <div class="card__media">{% media item.data.cover, "", { ratio: "4/3", kind: item.data.coverKind or d.kind, sizes: "(min-width: 40rem) 14rem, 100vw" } %}</div>
            <div class="card__body">
              <p class="card__meta"><span>{{ d.label }}</span>{% if item.data.years %}<span>{{ item.data.years }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
              <h3 class="card__title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h3>
              {%- if item.data.summary %}<p class="card__text">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </article>
        </li>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt work-method" aria-labelledby="work-method-title">
  <div class="container stack stack--2xl">
    <div>
      <header class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">How I work</p>
        <h2 id="work-method-title">Measure, calculate, draw, <em>hand over</em></h2>
        <p class="lede">Most of my engineering work runs through the same four steps. They are the scope I delivered for the Thecho stone spout, and what you get when you bring me a site.</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3 class="steps__title">Survey</h3><p class="steps__text">Every job starts on site, with a measured survey and notes on the condition of what is there.</p></li>
        <li><h3 class="steps__title">Calculate</h3><p class="steps__text">Hydraulic discharge calculations and structural analysis, so the design is grounded in numbers.</p></li>
        <li><h3 class="steps__title">Draw</h3><p class="steps__text">Computer-aided design (CAD) plans and cross-sections that a builder, a municipality or a researcher can read.</p></li>
        <li><h3 class="steps__title">Hand over</h3><p class="steps__text">Recommendations and a cost estimate, documented so the work can go ahead.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="work-clients">
      <h2 class="label work-clients__title" id="work-clients-title">Worked with and for</h2>
      <div>
        {%- set clientsLabelledBy = "work-clients-title" %}
        {% include "partials/clients.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band--dark band--edge" aria-labelledby="work-cta-title">
  <div class="container cta-band">
    <div class="stack stack--s">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work with me</p>
      <h2 class="cta-band__title" id="work-cta-title">A spout, a site or a school <em>in mind</em>?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Tell me what you need and by when. I usually reply {{ site.replyTime }}.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cluster">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/work-with-me/#enquire">Work with me{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{% icon "mail" %}Email me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
